    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "music or stuff doesn't really change the fact that he's not coming back. it just feels like i'm waiting for something that's never going to happen. everyone says \"time heals\" but it just feels like more time is just more empty space. what's the point of just sitting here in the silence day after day if everything eventually just ends like this anyway?",
