      "content": "i don't want self care. that just feels like filling a hole with nothing. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if the silence just stayed permanent. like if i didn't have to keep waking up to this emptiness every single morning. it feels so much more logical to just stop fighting the quiet and let it happen.",
